('creature', 'line-ray', 'Ley Line Energy Blast', 'Up to 2D6 S.D.C. or M.D.', 1, '1,000 feet (305 m) +400 feet (122 m) per level of experience', 'Only while on a ley line. One melee action. Damage set in increments of 1D6 and does not grow with age or experience. Costs one P.P.E. for S.D.C. bolts or five for M.D.C.', 3),
